  ............KK..
  ...........KeeK.
  ..........KEEeK.
  .........KEEEK..
  ........KEEEK...
  ..KK...KEEEK....
  .KeeK.KEEEK.....
  .KEEKKEEEK......
  .KEEEEEEEK......
  ..KEEEEEK.......
  ...KEEEK........
  ....KEK.........
  .....K..........
